t/issues/116851#issuecomment-3977231323","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116851","id":3977231323,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tD7vb","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-28T14:21:24Z","updated_at":"2026-02-28T14:21:24Z","body":"> Should the default setting use wayland if it is available?\n\nI believe it's still not production-ready, hence why Godot still defaults to X11.\n\nBut if the issue remains on the X11 backend, it's worth it to explore just to ensure if it's an issue from Godot or from your WM.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3977231323/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3977265974","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116851#issuecomment-3977265974","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116851","id":3977265974,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tEEM2","user":{"login":"Goldenlion5648","id":32916571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTE2NTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32916571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648","html_url":"https://github.com/Goldenlion5648","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-28T14:50:53Z","updated_at":"2026-02-28T14:50:53Z","body":"There isn't any warning in the settings screen about being experimental.\n\n<img width=\"953\" height=\"532\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/abf9b9da-fb95-4bbd-a20d-9dae75da7440\" />\n\n\nI'm using omarchy, and I believe the only custom window settings set are those that come with omarchy by default below (from my local file `/home/golden/.local/share/omarchy/default/hypr/windows.conf`) (I'm not super familiar with hyprland/wayland):\n\n```\n# See https://wiki.hyprland.org/Configuring/Window-Rules/ for more\n# Hyprland 0.53+ syntax\nwindowrule = suppress_event maximize, match:class .*\n\n# Just dash of opacity by default\nwindowrule = opacity 0.97 0.9, match:class .*\n\n# Fix some dragging issues with XWayland\nwindowrule = no_focus on, match:class ^$, match:title ^$, match:xwayland 1, match:float 1, match:fullscreen 0, match:pin 0\n\n# App-specific tweaks\nsource = ~/.local/share/omarchy/default/hypr/apps.conf\n```\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3977265974/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]